// the affected modules through Deps.OnSourceGateChanged and answer with the
// notified count; on disable, notify nothing and answer queued=0 (the spec's
// disable wakes no derivation). Order is the acceptance contract: validation
// runs BEFORE any write, so an unknown plugin answers 400 with the prefs table
// untouched. Any closure nil → 503 (the adminSources posture); a closure or
// store error → 500 (fail-fast, like every other read/write here).
//
// @Summary     Enable or disable a metadata source module-wide
// @Tags        admin
// @ID          admin-source-patch
// @Router      /admin/sources/{plugin_id} [patch]
// @Param       plugin_id path string                  true "plugin id"
// @Param       request   body sourcePatchRequest      true "gate to write"
